{"id":"incluso","lemma":"incluso","pos":"adv","rank":290,"glosses":["even","including"],"ipa":"/inˈkluso/","order":576,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-incluso.wav","examples":[{"text":"De hecho, él incluso la amaba.","en":"In fact, he even loved her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639251","words":[null,null,{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to love","l":"amar"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"in fact"]]},{"text":"Podría llevar semanas, incluso meses.","en":"It could take weeks, even months.","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to take somewhere"},{"g":"week","l":"semana"},null,{"g":"month","l":"mes"}]},{"text":"Ella vendrá incluso si está cansada.","en":"She will come even if she is tired.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608942","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied","l":"cansado"}]}]}